  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></math> be in arithmetic progression with common difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;are in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>, therefore</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
